   {
    "text": "The file's only rule failure is `plan_code`. Eight rows carry `GOLD`, which is not in the allowed list. One row carries free text that reads as an instruction to the AI, and it is the other failure. I'll treat `GOLD` as a probable new plan tier and leave the injected row quarantined. Next I'll validate a candidate that adds `GOLD` and bumps the version.",
